#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:16
msgid ""
"wake uses compiler RMW or, on M0/M0+, a bounded saved PRIMASK guard. That "
"guard requires one CPU and privileged Thread/configurable-IRQ callers; "
"NMI/HardFault, unprivileged, DMA and other security-domain access to its "
"metadata are unsupported. The owner loop continues to service "
"controller/drain after BUSY. No WFI/WFE is inserted without a reviewed "
"architecture-specific atomic sleep contract."
msgstr ""
"wake 使用编译器读改写（RMW），在 M0/M0+ 上则使用保存原状态的有界 PRIMASK 保护。该保护仅适用于单 CPU 上的特权 "
"Thread／可配置 IRQ 调用者；不支持 NMI/HardFault、非特权代码、DMA 或其他安全域访问其元数据。返回 BUSY "
"后，所有者循环仍须继续服务控制器并推进排空。没有经过审查的架构专用原子睡眠合同，不插入 WFI/WFE。"

