#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:16
msgid ""
"Port whose wait returns BUSY while unchanged before deadline; "
"NX_DEADLINE_NEVER disables expiry, never implies blocking"
msgstr "等待端口：截止时间前若状态未变，wait 返回 BUSY；NX_DEADLINE_NEVER 禁用到期，不意味着阻塞"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:16
