#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "Initialize unpublished ring and caller-owned entries."
msgstr "初始化尚未发布的环与调用者提供的条目。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid ""
"Startup or exclusive lifecycle owner only. Both allocations remain alive "
"until all publishers and readers are stopped. Entries cannot alias ring "
"state or a submitted record."
msgstr "仅限启动上下文或独占生命周期所有者。两块存储都必须保持存活，直到所有发布者和读取者停止。条目不得与环状态或已提交记录存在内存别名。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "[out] Unused caller-owned state."
msgstr "[out] 尚未使用、由调用者拥有的状态。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "[in] Naturally aligned contiguous entry storage."
msgstr "[in] 自然对齐的连续条目存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "[in] Nonzero storage length, at most UINT32_MAX."
msgstr "[in] 非零存储长度，至多为 UINT32_MAX。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID without modifying storage on rejection."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；拒绝时不修改存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "Copy one event under a bounded saved interrupt mask."
msgstr "在有界且保存原屏蔽状态的临界区内复制一个事件。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid ""
"Privileged Thread/configurable IRQ on one CPU only. NMI/HardFault, "
"unprivileged, SMP, DMA and other security worlds are excluded. Full rings "
"retain older records and saturate the lost-record counter. No clock "
"callback, OS operation, heap, string formatting or transport is used."
msgstr ""
"仅适用于单 CPU 上的特权 Thread／可配置 IRQ。排除 NMI/HardFault、非特权代码、SMP、DMA "
"和其他安全域。环满时保留较早记录，并使丢失记录计数器饱和递增。不使用时钟回调、OS 操作、堆、字符串格式化或传输机制。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "[inout] Initialized ring."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的环。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "[in] Stable record until this call returns."
msgstr "[in] 保持稳定直到本次调用返回的记录。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY when full, INVALID or CONTEXT."
msgstr "SUCCESS、环满时的 BUSY、INVALID 或 CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "Consume one event from caller-owned ring."
msgstr "从调用者拥有的环中消费一个事件。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid ""
"Same privileged single-CPU domain as write. Failed reads leave destination "
"unchanged. This is diagnostic storage, never a completion queue or "
"application work queue."
msgstr "与 write 使用相同的特权单 CPU 域。读取失败时目标保持不变。这是诊断存储，不能用作完成队列或应用工作队列。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "[inout] Initialized ring with live producers."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且仍有存活生产者的环。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "[out] Separate caller-owned destination."
msgstr "[out] 调用者拥有的独立目标存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY when empty, INVALID or CONTEXT."
msgstr "SUCCESS、环空时的 BUSY、INVALID 或 CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "Snapshot the saturating overflow count."
msgstr "读取饱和溢出计数快照。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "Uses the same bounded saved-mask domain as record access."
msgstr "与记录访问使用相同的有界、保存原屏蔽状态的执行域。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "[in] Initialized ring."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的环。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "[out] Caller-owned result."
msgstr "[out] 调用者拥有的结果存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or CONTEXT."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "One opaque diagnostic record; interpretation belongs to its owner."
msgstr "一个不透明诊断记录；解释责任属于其所有者。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:26
msgid "Explicit ring state, with no default pool, worker or transport."
msgstr "显式环状态，不提供默认池、执行任务或传输机制。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:32
msgid "freertos.h"
msgstr "freertos.h"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Per-object static FreeRTOS storage and optional thin services."
msgstr "每对象静态 FreeRTOS 存储与可选轻量服务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Running task operations require privileged unmasked Thread mode; IRQ wake "
"has its own contract. Before scheduler start, the selected Baseline port may"
" retain PRIMASK=1 or the Mainline port its exact syscall BASEPRI; all other "
"masks must be zero. Matching a value cannot prove mask provenance. Unsafe "
"contexts return CONTEXT before mutating kernel APIs or object storage; a "
"scheduler-state read may be needed. Startup permits init, task creation, "
"wake and zero-wait queues. Wait, join and nonzero waits require a running "
"scheduler. Port binding and sequence snapshots remain reads. MPU user-task "
"gateways and cross-world secure task calls are outside these privileged, "
"current-security-domain APIs."
msgstr ""
"运行期任务操作要求特权、未屏蔽的 Thread 模式；IRQ 唤醒有独立合同。调度器启动前，选定的 Baseline 端口可保留 "
"PRIMASK=1，Mainline 端口可保留其准确的系统调用 "
"BASEPRI；其他屏蔽值都必须为零。数值匹配不能证明屏蔽状态的来源。不安全的上下文会在修改内核 API 状态或对象存储之前返回 "
"CONTEXT；可能需要读取调度器状态。启动阶段允许初始化、创建任务、唤醒和零等待队列操作。wait、join "
"和非零等待要求调度器正在运行。端口绑定和序列快照始终只读。MPU 用户任务网关及跨安全域的 Secure 任务调用不属于这些特权、当前安全域 API "
"的范围。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Typedefs"
msgstr "类型定义"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Caller-owned single-operation latch for a closable queue."
msgstr "调用者拥有的单操作锁存器，用于可关闭队列。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Test whether the current context may call kernel ISR APIs."
msgstr "检查当前上下文是否允许调用内核 ISR API。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Native POSIX has no physical IRQ and returns false. NMI, faults and kernel-"
"owned exceptions are rejected before entering FreeRTOS. Mainline "
"priority/grouping must respect the syscall ceiling. Baseline PRIMASK ports "
"accept every configurable IRQ and do not read Mainline priority grouping. "
"Nonsecure permission does not exclude Secure-side accesses."
msgstr ""
"Native POSIX 没有物理 IRQ，返回 false。NMI、故障和内核拥有的异常会在进入 FreeRTOS 前被拒绝。Mainline "
"的优先级／分组必须遵守系统调用优先级上限。Baseline PRIMASK 端口接受所有可配置 IRQ，不读取 Mainline "
"优先级分组。Nonsecure 侧权限不排除 Secure 侧访问。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"True for a privileged unmasked external Cortex-M IRQ within the selected "
"CPU/SoC bounds and kernel mask contract"
msgstr "仅当当前为特权、未屏蔽的外部 Cortex-M IRQ，且符合选定 CPU／SoC 边界及内核屏蔽合同，才返回 true"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Initialize unused notification storage."
msgstr "初始化尚未使用的通知存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Task/startup context; no heap or timer daemon is needed."
msgstr "任务／启动上下文；不需要堆或定时器守护任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[out] Caller storage, zeroed before first use"
msgstr "[out] 调用者提供的存储，首次使用前清零"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS or invalid/context/initialization error"
msgstr "SUCCESS 或无效参数／上下文／初始化错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Bind a latched single-waiter notification."
msgstr "绑定序列锁存、单等待者通知。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Task wake uses xSemaphoreGive. IRQ wake validates priority then uses "
"xSemaphoreGiveFromISR. Saturated latch is harmless; sequence and request "
"predicates remain authoritative. No deferred daemon publishes wakes."
msgstr ""
"任务唤醒使用 xSemaphoreGive。IRQ 唤醒先验证优先级，再使用 "
"xSemaphoreGiveFromISR。锁存器饱和无害；序列和请求谓词仍是权威依据。不通过延迟守护任务发布唤醒。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Initialized live storage"
msgstr "[in] 已初始化且存活的存储"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Notification port using nx_time_now_us clock domain"
msgstr "使用 nx_time_now_us 时钟域的通知端口"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Destroy after publishers and waiter have stopped and joined."
msgstr "发布者和等待者均停止并完成 join 后再销毁。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Task context. Quiescence is required beyond this busy check."
msgstr "任务上下文。除了本项 busy 检查，还必须确保所有使用者静止。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[inout] Live storage with no future users"
msgstr "[inout] 存活存储，之后不再有使用者"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY if a waiter is still registered, or error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、仍有等待者登记时的 BUSY，或错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Create one task from its exact caller-owned stack and TCB."
msgstr "使用调用者提供的准确栈和 TCB 创建一个任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Task/startup context. No hidden worker or maximum pool. Entry must return in"
" privileged Thread mode, with manual interrupt masks restored and the "
"scheduler resumed after any temporary suspension."
msgstr ""
"任务／启动上下文。没有隐藏执行任务或池容量上限。入口返回时必须处于特权 Thread 模式，已恢复手动设置的中断屏蔽，并在任何临时挂起后恢复调度器。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[out] Zero-initialized unused control storage"
msgstr "[out] 已清零且尚未使用的控制存储"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Kernel diagnostic name, copied by the kernel"
msgstr "[in] 内核诊断名称，由内核复制"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] StackType_t array kept until successful join"
msgstr "[in] 保留直到成功 join 的 StackType_t 数组"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"[in] Actual capacity, at least the selected port startup minimum; runtime "
"stack budget remains caller-owned"
msgstr "[in] 实际容量，至少满足选定端口的启动最小值；运行期栈预算仍由调用者负责"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Priority below configMAX_PRIORITIES"
msgstr "[in] 小于 configMAX_PRIORITIES 的优先级"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Application entry, may return after cooperative stop"
msgstr "[in] 应用入口，可在协作停止后返回"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Entry context kept until join"
msgstr "[in] 保留直到 join 的入口上下文"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS or invalid/context/start error"
msgstr "SUCCESS 或无效参数／上下文／启动错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Discard one created task before its wrapper has executed."
msgstr "在包装函数执行之前，丢弃一个已创建的任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Single privileged startup lifecycle owner; scheduler state must be "
"NOT_STARTED. The kernel candidate is first suspended to remove its retained "
"TCB reference before deletion. No unmatched vTaskSuspendAll may remain "
"during bootstrap: NOT_STARTED cannot reveal the kernel's private suspension "
"nesting. This caller precondition applies before mutation. Success permits "
"TCB, stack and context reuse after all external users are quiescent. This "
"does not cancel or join an executed task."
msgstr ""
"仅限一个特权启动生命周期所有者；调度器状态必须为 NOT_STARTED。内核候选任务先被挂起，以在删除前移除内核保留的 TCB "
"引用。bootstrap 期间不得遗留未配对的 vTaskSuspendAll：NOT_STARTED "
"无法揭示内核私有的挂起嵌套层数。该调用者前置条件必须在修改前满足。成功后，只有在所有外部使用者均静止时，才允许复用 TCB、栈和上下文。这不会取消或 "
"join 已执行的任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[inout] Live caller-owned static task, unused by other callers"
msgstr "[inout] 存活、由调用者拥有且未被其他调用者使用的静态任务"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after synchronous kernel deletion and latch cleanup; INVALID for "
"absent, incomplete or already entered control; CONTEXT for ISR, "
"unprivileged, noncanonical masks or a running/suspended scheduler, without "
"mutation"
msgstr ""
"仅在同步内核删除及锁存器清理完成后返回 SUCCESS；控制状态不存在、不完整或已经进入执行时返回 "
"INVALID；ISR、非特权、非规范屏蔽状态或调度器正在运行／挂起时返回 CONTEXT，且不修改状态"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Join a cooperatively returned task and reclaim kernel state."
msgstr "对协作返回的任务执行 join，并回收内核状态。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Single joiner, task context. The entry return parks its wrapper; no self-"
"delete/idle cleanup race releases caller storage early. Stop producers, keep"
" bus owner draining, join producers, then join owner."
msgstr ""
"单个 join 调用者，任务上下文。入口返回后停驻于包装函数；不会因自删除／Idle "
"清理竞态而提前释放调用者存储。先停止生产者，保持总线所有者推进排空，join 生产者，再 join 所有者。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[inout] Started task, distinct from current task"
msgstr "[inout] 已启动且不是当前任务的任务"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Absolute wait deadline in nx_time_now_us domain"
msgstr "[in] nx_time_now_us 域内的绝对等待截止时间"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after external vTaskDelete removes the task; TIMEOUT retains "
"handle, TCB, stack and context; CONTEXT rejects unsafe CPU context, self-"
"join or stopped scheduler"
msgstr ""
"仅当外部 vTaskDelete 已移除任务后返回 SUCCESS；TIMEOUT 保留句柄、TCB、栈和上下文；CONTEXT 拒绝不安全的 CPU "
"上下文、自 join 或已停止的调度器"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Create an exact-sized static byte-copy queue."
msgstr "创建准确容量的静态字节复制队列。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[out] Zero-initialized caller queue control"
msgstr "[out] 已清零的调用者队列控制存储"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Byte buffer kept until destroy"
msgstr "[in] 保留直到 destroy 的字节缓冲区"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
