#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Copy an item with a bounded relative kernel wait."
msgstr "在有界内核相对等待内复制一个条目。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Task context. Admission/stop belongs to the application's explicit owner "
