msgstr "[out] 已配置的条目字节容量，仅在成功时有效"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Destroy after admission is stopped and all users joined."
msgstr "准入已停止且全部使用者完成 join 后再销毁。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[inout] Live drained queue, no future operations"
msgstr "[inout] 存活且已排空的队列，之后不再有操作"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY while users/items remain, or invalid/context"
