#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Send using one absolute monotonic deadline."
msgstr "使用一个绝对单调截止时间发送。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Immediate readiness wins over expiration. Stop admission and user quiescence"
