msgstr "[in] 已配置数量的字节，借用直到返回"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] nx_time_now_us domain, NEVER permits long waits"
msgstr "[in] nx_time_now_us 域；NEVER 允许长时间等待"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS, TIMEOUT or validation/context error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、TIMEOUT 或验证／上下文错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Receive using one absolute monotonic deadline."
msgstr "使用一个绝对单调截止时间接收。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[out] Configured bytes valid only on SUCCESS"
msgstr "[out] 已配置数量的字节，仅在 SUCCESS 时有效"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] nx_time_now_us domain"
msgstr "[in] nx_time_now_us 域"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Bind an exclusive slot of one live receiver task."
msgstr "绑定一个存活接收任务的独占通知槽。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Caller ensures slot exclusivity. No global slot registry, allocation, slot "
"discovery or cross-world synchronization."
msgstr "调用者确保通知槽独占。不提供全局槽注册表、分配、槽发现或跨安全域同步。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[out] Zeroed caller storage"
msgstr "[out] 已清零的调用者存储"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Task retained until all publishers quiesce"
msgstr "[in] 保留直到所有发布者静止的任务"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Exclusively owned kernel notification slot"
msgstr "[in] 独占拥有的内核通知槽"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED by OS profile"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT，或 OS profile 不支持时的 UNSUPPORTED"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Get a direct notification wait port."
msgstr "取得直接任务通知的等待端口。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Only receiver may wait. Task/validated IRQ publishers use the exclusive "
"slot; notification remains a predicate hint."
msgstr "仅接收者可以等待。任务／已验证 IRQ 发布者使用独占槽；通知仍只是谓词提示。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Live explicitly bound storage"
msgstr "[in] 存活且已显式绑定的存储"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Port using nx_time_now_us or an invalid zero port"
msgstr "使用 nx_time_now_us 的端口，或无效的零端口"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Unbind after all publishers stop and join."
msgstr "全部发布者停止并完成 join 后解除绑定。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Does not delete receiver or clear its kernel slot. Receiver and storage must"
" outlive every retained port and publisher."
msgstr "不删除接收者，也不清除其内核槽。接收者和存储必须比每个保留的端口及发布者存活更久。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY if waiting, or validation/context error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、正在等待时的 BUSY，或验证／上下文错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Start a task whose entry must never return."
msgstr "启动入口函数绝不允许返回的任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"No join latch, destroy or forced deletion. Choose joinable tasks for "
"cooperative shutdown and reclaimable storage."
msgstr "不提供 join 锁存器、destroy 或强制删除。需要协作关闭和可回收存储时，应选择可 join 的任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[out] Zeroed permanent control, retained until reset"
msgstr "[out] 已清零的永久控制存储，保留直到复位"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Copied kernel diagnostic name"
msgstr "[in] 由内核复制的诊断名称"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Aligned actual stack retained until reset"
msgstr "[in] 已对齐的实际栈，保留直到复位"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Capacity includes reviewed startup minimum"
msgstr "[in] 包含已审查启动最小值的容量"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Below configMAX_PRIORITIES"
msgstr "[in] 小于 configMAX_PRIORITIES"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Permanent entry; return violates kernel contract"
msgstr "[in] 永久入口；返回将违反内核合同"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Retained until reset"
msgstr "[in] 保留直到复位"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS or validation/context/start error"
msgstr "SUCCESS 或验证／上下文／启动错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Initialize one exact caller-owned queue waiter."
msgstr "初始化调用者提供的准确队列等待者存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[out] Zeroed storage, one simultaneous operation maximum"
msgstr "[out] 已清零的存储，最多同时执行一个操作"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Destroy only after all operations stop and join."
msgstr "全部操作停止并完成 join 后才允许销毁。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[inout] Live storage without future callers"
msgstr "[inout] 存活存储，之后不再有调用者"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY if active, or validation/context error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、活动时的 BUSY，或验证／上下文错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Initialize an optional reliably closable byte-copy queue."
msgstr "初始化可选、能可靠关闭的字节复制队列。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"No hidden worker or waiter pool. Each concurrent blocking operation supplies"
" its own initialized waiter. Broadcasting pauses scheduling while visiting "
"at most maximum_waiters latches. Kernel payload copies and each latch signal"
" have their own short IRQ guards. Budget scheduling delay and IRQ latency "
"separately. Large payloads should queue stable handles. The registry is "
"single-core and task-only."
msgstr ""
"没有隐藏执行任务或等待者池。每个并发阻塞操作都提供自己的已初始化等待者。广播在访问至多 maximum_waiters "
"个锁存器期间暂停调度。内核载荷复制和每次锁存器信号各自使用短 IRQ 保护。调度延迟和 IRQ "
"延迟须分别预算。大载荷应通过队列传递稳定句柄。登记机制仅适用于单核和任务上下文。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[out] Zeroed control kept until destroy"
msgstr "[out] 已清零的控制存储，保留直到 destroy"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Payload buffer kept until destroy"
msgstr "[in] 载荷缓冲区，保留直到 destroy"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Actual payload capacity"
msgstr "[in] 实际载荷容量"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Positive item count"
msgstr "[in] 正数条目数量"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Positive byte-copy size"
msgstr "[in] 正数的字节复制大小"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Explicit positive simultaneous-call budget"
msgstr "[in] 显式、正数的同时调用预算"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Send with close-aware admission and absolute deadline."
msgstr "发送时执行关闭感知准入，并采用绝对截止时间。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Readiness/admission and close serialize in a kernel task scheduling guard. A"
" latched wake closes wake-before-sleep."
msgstr "就绪／准入与 close 在内核任务调度保护内串行化。锁存唤醒消除先唤醒、后睡眠的竞态。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[inout] Live closable queue"
msgstr "[inout] 存活的可关闭队列"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] Bytes borrowed until return, never after timeout"
msgstr "[in] 借用直到返回的字节，超时后绝不保留"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[in] nx_time_now_us domain, NEVER supported"
msgstr "[in] nx_time_now_us 域，支持 NEVER"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[inout] Exclusive initialized caller waiter"
msgstr "[inout] 调用者独占、已初始化的等待者"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS, CANCELLED after close, TIMEOUT, BUSY or error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、关闭后的 CANCELLED、TIMEOUT、BUSY 或错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Receive existing items after close, then CANCELLED."
msgstr "关闭后仍接收已有条目，排空后返回 CANCELLED。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS, CANCELLED when closed/empty, TIMEOUT or error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、已关闭且为空时的 CANCELLED、TIMEOUT 或错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Stop sends and wake every currently registered waiter."
msgstr "停止发送，并唤醒当前登记的全部等待者。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Task-only, no forced cancellation or task deletion. Close does not join "
"users or authorize storage reclamation."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，不提供强制取消或任务删除。close 不会 join 使用者，也不授权回收存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS, including repeated close, or validation/context"
msgstr "SUCCESS（包括重复 close），或验证／上下文错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Destroy a closed, drained and quiesced queue."
msgstr "销毁已关闭、已排空且静止的队列。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Stop/join producers, drain with owner, join consumers and then destroy queue"
" and every waiter independently."
msgstr "停止并 join 生产者，由所有者排空，join 消费者，然后分别销毁队列和每个等待者。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "[inout] Live queue without future entrants"
msgstr "[inout] 存活队列，之后不再有调用者进入"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY while open/users/items remain, or error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、尚未关闭／仍有使用者／仍有条目时的 BUSY，或错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Static binary latch; one waiter, independently quiesced publishers."
msgstr "静态二值锁存器；一个等待者，发布者分别停止并排空。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Task has its own TCB; stack is supplied with its actual word count."
msgstr "任务拥有独立 TCB；栈以其实际字数显式供给。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid ""
"Control fields are adapter-owned. The caller zero-initializes storage before"
" first use and does not modify live fields. Entry is consumed as the wrapper"
" begins execution; context remains borrowed until successful join or "
"prestart discard."
msgstr ""
"控制字段由适配器拥有。调用者在首次使用前将存储清零，不得修改存活字段。包装函数开始执行时即消耗入口；上下文继续被借用，直到成功 join 或启动前 "
"discard。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Queue control only; actual depth/item byte storage is external."
msgstr "仅队列控制状态；实际深度／条目字节存储由外部提供。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Fixed receiver and exclusive kernel notification slot; no latch."
msgstr "固定接收者及独占内核通知槽；不含锁存器。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Permanent task control without a join completion semaphore."
msgstr "永久任务控制，不含 join 完成信号量。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:34
msgid "Opt-in close broadcasts; raw queue storage remains unchanged."
msgstr "显式选择的关闭广播；原始队列存储不变。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:40
msgid "freertos_diagnostics.h"
msgstr "freertos_diagnostics.h"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:42
msgid "Bounded explicit FreeRTOS trace sink without global storage."
msgstr "显式、有界的 FreeRTOS 跟踪接收端，不使用全局存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:42
#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Enums"
msgstr "枚举"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:42
msgid ""
"Maintained kernel trace identities; product interpretation is external."
msgstr "维护范围内的内核跟踪身份；产品解释位于外部。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:42
#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "取值："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:42
msgid "Consume one bounded kernel trace event."
msgstr "消费一个有界内核跟踪事件。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:42
msgid ""
"Application may override the weak no-op and write an explicit "
"nx_diagnostic_ring_t. May run under kernel masks or configurable IRQ, so "
"never block, allocate, format, transmit, acquire OS locks or call kernel "
"services. The sink owns timestamp and lifetime; no buffer is provided "
"automatically. Trace profile enables real kernel hooks."
msgstr ""
"应用可覆盖弱空操作，并写入显式 nx_diagnostic_ring_t。可能在内核屏蔽状态或可配置 IRQ "
"下运行，因此绝不能阻塞、分配、格式化、传输、取得 OS 锁或调用内核服务。接收端负责时间戳和生命周期；不会自动提供缓冲区。trace profile "
"启用真实内核钩子。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:42
msgid "[in] Maintained trace kind."
msgstr "[in] 维护范围内的跟踪类别。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:42
msgid "[in] Opaque task identity, never a dereference license."
msgstr "[in] 不透明任务身份，绝不构成解引用许可。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:42
msgid "[in] Optional caller-defined numeric diagnostic."
msgstr "[in] 可选的调用者自定义数值诊断信息。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:48
msgid "freertos_mpu.h"
msgstr "freertos_mpu.h"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid "Privileged static lifecycle for isolated MPU user tasks."
msgstr "隔离 MPU 用户任务的特权静态生命周期。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid "User data is nonexecuting normal RAM with only these permissions."
msgstr "用户数据是不可执行的普通 RAM，仅允许这些权限。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid "Create an unprivileged task from exact caller-owned storage."
msgstr "使用调用者准确存储创建非特权任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid ""
"Privileged Thread only, scheduler not suspended, no manual masks. Rejection "
"retains no references and calls no kernel creation API. Actual linker bounds"
" and MPU_TYPE are checked. Minimum creation capacity is 64 words; "
"applications budget actual execution depth separately. No heap or object "
"pool."
msgstr ""
"仅限特权 Thread，调度器未挂起且没有手动屏蔽。拒绝时不保留引用，不调用内核创建 API。检查实际链接器边界及 MPU_TYPE。创建容量最少为 "
"64 个字；应用须另外预算实际执行深度。不使用堆或对象池。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid "[inout] Cold or live-free metadata in protected linker RAM."
msgstr "[inout] 受保护链接器 RAM 中的冷态或已无存活任务的元数据。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid "[in] Validated user entry, stack and data mappings."
msgstr "[in] 已验证的用户入口、栈和数据映射。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/IO before admission. The GPIO profile "
"also rejects task epoch OVERFLOW."
msgstr ""
"返回 SUCCESS；或在接纳前返回 INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE／BUSY／IO。GPIO 配置还会以 OVERFLOW "
"拒绝任务代次溢出。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid "Delete another isolated task after external users quiesce."
msgstr "外部使用者静止后，删除另一个隔离任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid ""
"One privileged lifecycle owner stops external access first. Kernel deletion "
"synchronously removes scheduler references. Self deletion is rejected; no "
"hidden reaper."
msgstr "一个特权生命周期所有者先停止外部访问。内核删除会同步移除调度器引用。拒绝自删除；不设隐藏回收任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid ""
"The GPIO profile returns BUSY while its authority pins the task. Close and "
"join before deletion. A closing marker prevents reopen during kernel "
"deletion; the epoch survives."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 配置在其授权持有任务生命周期固定引用时返回 BUSY。删除前须先 close 和 join。closing "
"标记防止在内核删除期间重新打开；保留该代次。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid "[inout] Owned live protected metadata; never the calling task."
msgstr "[inout] 已拥有、存活且受保护的元数据；绝不能是调用任务本身。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid "Success, INVALID, CONTEXT, STATE or BUSY."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT、STATE 或 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid "A caller-selected exact region, copied during task creation."
msgstr "调用者选定的准确区域，在任务创建时复制。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid "Complete caller-owned protected task metadata."
msgstr "调用者拥有的完整受保护任务元数据。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid ""
"Zero-initialize in privileged RAM before first start. The TCB includes the "
"real port context and protected stack. One privileged lifecycle owner "
"serializes start/delete."
msgstr "首次启动前，在特权 RAM 中零初始化。TCB 包含真实端口上下文和受保护栈。一个特权生命周期所有者串行调用 start/delete。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid ""
"The GPIO profile requires cold zero-initialization and keeps the task epoch "
"across deletion; never reset that history."
msgstr "GPIO 配置要求冷态零初始化，并在删除后保留任务代次；不得重置该历史。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid "Immutable creation inputs, borrowed for this call only."
msgstr "不可变创建输入，仅在本次调用内被借用。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:50
msgid ""
"The entry must be explicit user code and must not return. Stack and context "
"data remain borrowed until owner deletion; regions never include kernel RAM,"
" code or MMIO. Context must be contained in the user stack, user flash or "
"mapped data. Names terminate within configMAX_TASK_NAME_LEN in a readable "
"reserved linker region; names are copied cold."
msgstr ""
"入口必须是显式用户代码，且不得返回。栈和上下文数据保持被借用，直到所有者删除；区域不得包含内核 RAM、代码或 MMIO。上下文必须完整位于用户栈、用户"
" Flash 或已映射数据内。名称必须在可读的链接器保留区域内、在 configMAX_TASK_NAME_LEN 长度内终止；名称在冷路径复制。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:56
msgid "freertos_mpu_gpio.h"
msgstr "freertos_mpu_gpio.h"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "One protected-task scalar GPIO WRITE authority."
msgstr "供一个受保护任务使用的标量 GPIO WRITE 授权。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid ""
"Author  Nexus Team   Version  1.0.0   Date  2026-10-20   Copyright  "
"Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus Team"
msgstr ""
"作者  Nexus Team   版本  1.0.0   日期  2026-10-20   版权  Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus "
"Team"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "2026-10-20"
msgstr "2026-10-20"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "Open the fixed grant for its exact live protected task."
msgstr "为精确的存活受保护任务打开固定授权。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid ""
"Privileged Thread; scheduler running or not yet started. BASEPRI/FAULTMASK "
"must be zero, except the selected port's bootstrap BASEPRI before scheduler "
"start. PRIMASK is saved and restored. This operation pins task deletion "
"until join."
msgstr ""
"特权 Thread；调度器正在运行或尚未启动。BASEPRI/FAULTMASK 必须为零，但调度器启动前所选端口的引导 BASEPRI "
"除外。保存并恢复 PRIMASK。此操作固定任务生命周期，阻止其删除，直到 join。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid ""
"SUCCESS or INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY. Rejection leaves no partial pin."
msgstr "SUCCESS，或 INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE／BUSY。拒绝不遗留部分固定引用。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "Revoke further calls without deleting or stopping the GPIO."
msgstr "撤销后续调用；不删除任务，也不停止 GPIO。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid ""
"The same privileged lifecycle owner serializes open/close/ join and task "
"start/delete. NMI/HardFault never access this authority. Incoming interrupt "
"masks are preserved."
msgstr ""
"同一个特权生命周期所有者串行调用 open/close/join 和任务 start/delete。NMI/HardFault "
"不得访问此授权。保留传入的中断屏蔽状态。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT or STATE; preserves all pins."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT 或 STATE；保留全部固定引用。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "Join a closed authority before task deletion or GPIO stop."
msgstr "在删除任务或停止 GPIO 之前，对已关闭的授权执行 join。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid ""
"The single-core saved-mask boundary excludes every active scalar effect. "
"Join detaches its task pin before returning; it does not delete the task or "
"reset its lifetime epoch."
msgstr "单核上保存中断屏蔽状态的边界排除所有正在执行的标量效果。join 返回前解除其任务固定引用；不删除任务，也不重置其生命周期代次。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "SUCCESS detaches the pin; INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE retain it."
msgstr "SUCCESS 解除固定引用；INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE 保留固定引用。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "Immutable WRITE grant in privileged Flash."
msgstr "特权 Flash 中不可变的 WRITE 授权。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid ""
"port_slot addresses the readonly generated nx_binding_led pointer. The "
"initialized exact GPIOC PC7 face, operations and provider state outlive an "
"open authority through successful join. The sole lifecycle owner does not "
"stop or reconfigure that GPIO. No READ, toggle, pointer-copy or MMIO mapping"
" is granted."
msgstr ""
"port_slot 指向只读、生成的 nx_binding_led 指针。已初始化的精确 GPIOC PC7 "
"接口、操作表与提供者状态须在授权打开期间持续有效，直到成功 join。唯一生命周期所有者不得停止或重新配置该 GPIO。不授予 "
"READ、翻转、指针复制或 MMIO 映射能力。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "Caller-owned protected authority; zero only at cold startup."
msgstr "调用方拥有的受保护授权；仅在冷启动时清零。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid ""
"Treat all fields as private. Join detaches the captured task epoch, without "
"resetting the bound task's epoch history. Storage remains valid for the "
"linked binding's entire lifetime, including rejection and closed states."
msgstr ""
"所有字段均视为私有。join 解除所捕获任务代次的绑定，不重置绑定任务的代次历史。存储必须在所链接绑定的整个生命周期内保持有效，包括拒绝和关闭状态。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "One immutable assembly binding, in privileged Flash."
msgstr "特权 Flash 中单个不可变装配绑定。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid ""
"Define exactly one nx_freertos_mpu_gpio_binding symbol. Control and task are"
" disjoint privileged RAM; grant is privileged Flash. User arguments never "
"select these objects."
msgstr ""
"仅定义一个 nx_freertos_mpu_gpio_binding 符号。control 和 task 位于互不重叠的特权 RAM 中；grant "
"位于特权 Flash 中。用户参数从不选择这些对象。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:58
msgid "Keep the task epoch after deletion. Initialize only at cold startup."
msgstr "删除后保留任务代次。仅在冷启动时初始化。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:64
msgid "freertos_stack.h"
msgstr "freertos_stack.h"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:66
msgid "Optional bounded task stack paint snapshot."
msgstr "可选、有界的任务栈涂色快照。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:66
msgid "Copy bounded stack paint facts using actual kernel identity."
msgstr "使用真实内核身份复制有界栈涂色事实。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:66
msgid ""
"Privileged unmasked running Thread; task stack quiescent throughout the "
"scan. Available only with NEXUS_OS_TRACE. xTaskGetStaticBuffers verifies "
"TCB/stack identity, not size. The original capacity is a caller contract. No"
" task suspend, interrupt mask, allocation or live painting is performed. "
"Worst-case work is words*sizeof(StackType_t) byte reads. Paint is the locked"
" kernel's 0xA5. Untouched/touched bytes do not prove physical stack peaks. "
"The POSIX kernel port uses a separate pthread execution stack; its query is "
"not an MCU or Linux execution-stack peak measurement."
msgstr ""
"特权、未屏蔽、正在运行的 Thread；整个扫描期间任务栈必须静止。仅在 NEXUS_OS_TRACE "
"下可用。xTaskGetStaticBuffers 验证 "
"TCB／栈身份，不验证大小。原始容量属于调用者合同。不挂起任务、不屏蔽中断、不分配，也不对存活栈重新涂色。最坏工作量为读取 "
"words*sizeof(StackType_t) 个字节。涂色值是锁定内核使用的 0xA5。未触及／已触及的字节不能证明物理栈峰值。POSIX "
"内核端口使用独立的 pthread 执行栈；其查询不能测得 MCU 或 Linux 执行栈峰值。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:66
msgid "[in] Exact original TCB, stack and capacity, all live."
msgstr "[in] 准确的原始 TCB、栈及容量，均须存活。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:66
msgid "[out] Distinct output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出，拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:66
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT or STATE for a binding mismatch."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT，或绑定不匹配时的 STATE。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:66
msgid "Exact static task facts supplied at original creation."
msgstr "原始创建时提供的准确静态任务事实。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:66
msgid ""
"The caller retains all storage, excludes delete/join/discard and never "
"replaces the live binding. This is not a registry."
msgstr "调用者保留全部存储，排除 delete/join/discard，并且绝不替换存活绑定。这不是注册表。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:72
msgid "freertos_user.h"
msgstr "freertos_user.h"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "Narrow pointer-free services for MPU-isolated user tasks."
msgstr "MPU 隔离用户任务的窄接口、无指针服务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Defines"
msgstr "宏定义"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "Explicitly reviewed unprivileged executable code section."
msgstr "显式审查的非特权可执行代码段。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "Explicit user RAM, separate from kernel and provider state."
msgstr "显式用户 RAM，与内核和提供者状态分离。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "Explicit zero-initialized user storage in its reserved RAM span."
msgstr "在预留 RAM 区间中显式定义、零初始化的用户存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "Trusted static task metadata placed in protected kernel RAM."
msgstr "放入受保护内核 RAM 的可信静态任务元数据。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "Delay the calling user task through the real MPU SVC."
msgstr "通过真实 MPU SVC 延迟调用用户任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid ""
"Thread only with a running scheduler. No handle or pointer crosses the "
"boundary. This is not a microsecond deadline."
msgstr "仅限调度器正在运行的 Thread。边界两侧不传递句柄或指针。这不是微秒截止时间。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "[in] Relative kernel ticks; zero requests rescheduling."
msgstr "[in] 内核相对 tick 数；零表示请求重新调度。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "Read the kernel's wrapping 32-bit tick counter through SVC."
msgstr "通过 SVC 读取内核可回绕的 32 位 tick 计数器。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid ""
"Thread-only MPU profile service, distinct from Core time. No object handle "
"or pointer crosses this service."
msgstr "仅限 Thread 的 MPU 配置服务，与 Core 时间不同。此服务不跨边界传递对象句柄或指针。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "Current kernel tick count in the selected OS clock domain."
msgstr "选定 OS 时钟域内的当前内核 tick 计数。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "Write the current protected task's one static GPIO grant."
msgstr "通过当前受保护任务的一个静态 GPIO 授权执行写入。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid ""
"Thread only with a running scheduler. Unknown identifiers and out-of-grant "
"bits return PERMISSION; overlapping or zero masks return INVALID. No user "
"MMIO mapping, READ, toggle, OS wait, heap or pointer borrow is introduced. A"
" closed or stale task incarnation performs no GPIO write."
msgstr ""
"仅限 Thread，且调度器正在运行。未知标识符和授权外的位返回 PERMISSION；掩码重叠或两者均为零时返回 INVALID。不引入用户 MMIO"
" 映射、READ、翻转、OS 等待、堆分配或指针借用。已关闭或陈旧的任务代次不产生 GPIO 写入。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "[in] Exact assembly-local grant identifier, no pointer."
msgstr "[in] 精确的装配内授权标识符，不是指针。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "[in] Granted bits to set, disjoint from reset_mask."
msgstr "[in] 获授权可置位的位，与 reset_mask 不重叠。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "[in] Granted bits to reset."
msgstr "[in] 获授权可复位的位。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:74
msgid "Scalar SUCCESS or INVALID/PERMISSION/STATE/CONTEXT."
msgstr "标量 SUCCESS，或 INVALID／PERMISSION／STATE／CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:80
msgid "lowpower.h"
msgstr "lowpower.h"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
msgid "Explicit continuous-clock tickless timer port."
msgstr "显式的连续时钟无 tick 定时器端口。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
msgid "Bounded late alarm catch-up; larger delays violate the timer port."
msgstr "有界的延迟闹钟追赶；超出边界即违反定时器端口合同。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
msgid "Return the explicitly selected continuous timer port."
msgstr "返回显式选定的连续定时器端口。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
msgid ""
"A maintained SoC binding or application implementation overrides the weak "
"NULL default. The port and context remain live throughout the scheduler; no "
"runtime rebinding, hidden pool or worker is provided. Absence of a port "
"never stops ticks or sleeps."
msgstr ""
"维护范围内的 SoC 绑定或应用实现覆盖弱 NULL "
"默认值。端口和上下文必须在调度器整个生命周期内存活；不提供运行期重新绑定、隐藏池或执行任务。没有端口时绝不停止 tick，也不进入睡眠。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
msgid "Stable port or NULL to leave normal periodic ticking."
msgstr "稳定端口，或以 NULL 保持正常周期 tick。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
msgid "Kernel tickless hook with measured phase preservation."
msgstr "保留实测相位的内核无 tick 钩子。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
msgid ""
"Called only by Idle with scheduler suspended. Uses reviewed masked shallow "
"WFI, exact saved PRIMASK restoration and bounded pended-tick catch-up. The "
"configured tick rate must divide 1000000 exactly. The final kernel readiness"
" check precedes tick pause; a rejected pause makes no changes. Default "
"profiles do not call this hook. HIL must verify the concrete timer, clock "
"continuity and actual wake latency."
msgstr ""
"仅由 Idle 在调度器挂起时调用。使用经过审查的屏蔽状态浅睡眠 WFI、准确恢复保存的 PRIMASK，并有界追赶待处理 tick。配置的 tick "
"频率必须能整除 1000000。暂停 tick 前先做最后一次内核就绪检查；暂停被拒绝时不产生修改。默认 profile 不调用此钩子。HIL "
"必须验证具体定时器、时钟连续性和实际唤醒延迟。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
msgid "[in] Kernel's bounded next-unblock window."
msgstr "[in] 内核给出的有界、距下一次解除阻塞的窗口。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
msgid "Stopped-tick epoch with the concrete port's declared precision."
msgstr "tick 停止 epoch，精度以具体端口声明为准。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
msgid "Caller-owned, immutable tickless timer implementation."
msgstr "调用者拥有的不可变无 tick 定时器实现。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:82
msgid ""
"All methods run in privileged Idle Thread mode with PRIMASK=1 and scheduler "
"suspended. They are bounded, never block or call kernel functions. "
"pause_tick atomically stops the periodic tick and snapshots elapsed phase in"
" its current tick period; a pending tick is rejected without effects. "
"SUCCESS borrows the timer until resume_tick. now_us is the same monotonic "
"clock as snapshot, continuous during shallow sleep. arm_deadline programs an"
" enabled IRQ wake source; rejection retains no alarm. disarm removes only "
"that alarm. resume_tick restores the periodic source with its next expiry at"
" the supplied absolute clock instant, preserving phase within its declared "
"quantization and sampling bound rather than adding callback latency to every"
" tick. It must not publish an already accounted tick. The alarm wakes by "
"deadline; at most eight extra ticks of latency may be caught up. Reversed "
"clocks or larger latency fail stop. This does not configure clocks, NVIC, "
"SCR or a board timer."
msgstr ""
"全部方法在特权 Idle Thread 模式、PRIMASK=1 且调度器挂起时运行。方法必须有界，不阻塞、不调用内核函数。pause_tick "
"以原子方式停止周期 tick，并快照当前 tick 周期已经过的相位；若有 pending tick，则无效果地拒绝。SUCCESS "
"开始借用定时器，直到 resume_tick。now_us 必须与 snapshot 使用同一单调时钟，并在浅睡眠期间连续运行。arm_deadline"
" 配置已启用的 IRQ 唤醒源；拒绝时不得保留闹钟。disarm 仅撤销该闹钟。resume_tick "
"恢复周期源，下一次到期必须位于所供给的绝对时钟时刻；在已声明量化和采样边界内保持相位，而不是给每个 tick 累加回调延迟。不得发布已经计入的 "
"tick。闹钟必须不晚于截止时间唤醒；至多允许追赶八个额外 tick 的延迟。时钟倒退或更大延迟必须故障停止。本接口不配置时钟、NVIC、SCR "
"或板级定时器。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:88
msgid "native.h"
msgstr "native.h"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Explicit POSIX notification, queue and task storage."
msgstr "显式 POSIX 通知、队列与任务存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Read POSIX monotonic microseconds."
msgstr "读取 POSIX 单调微秒时间。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Clock value; clock_gettime failure is process-fatal"
msgstr "时钟值；clock_gettime 失败会导致进程终止"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Initialize a notification in unused caller storage."
msgstr "在调用者尚未使用的存储中初始化通知。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Task context; POSIX signal handlers are unsupported."
msgstr "任务上下文；不支持 POSIX 信号处理函数。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[out] Storage kept alive through all publishers"
msgstr "[out] 存储须比所有发布者存活更久"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "NX_SUCCESS or an initialization error"
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS 或初始化错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Bind a single-waiter latched notification port."
msgstr "绑定单等待者的序列锁存通知端口。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid ""
"Port using CLOCK_MONOTONIC absolute microseconds and NX_DEADLINE_NEVER for "
"untimed waiting"
msgstr "端口使用 CLOCK_MONOTONIC 绝对微秒时间；NX_DEADLINE_NEVER 表示不设超时的等待"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Destroy after external publisher quiescence."
msgstr "外部发布者静止后再销毁。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid ""
"Stop and join publishers first. The check cannot authorize a future call to "
"race destruction. No storage access is allowed afterward."
msgstr "先停止并 join 发布者。本项检查不能授权未来调用与销毁竞态执行。此后不允许访问存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[inout] Live storage with no future publishers"
msgstr "[inout] 存活存储，之后不再有发布者"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "NX_SUCCESS or BUSY when a waiter is still registered"
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS，或仍有等待者登记时的 BUSY"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Initialize an explicit bounded byte-copy queue."
msgstr "初始化显式、有界的字节复制队列。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Task context; caller keeps buffer until successful destroy."
msgstr "任务上下文；调用者保留缓冲区，直到成功 destroy。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[out] Unused caller storage"
msgstr "[out] 尚未使用的调用者存储"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[in] Caller-owned byte buffer"
msgstr "[in] 调用者拥有的字节缓冲区"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[in] Number of items, greater than zero"
msgstr "[in] 条目数量，大于零"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[in] Bytes per item, greater than zero"
msgstr "[in] 每条目字节数，大于零"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "NX_SUCCESS or invalid/initialization error"
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS 或无效参数／初始化错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Copy one item to the queue."
msgstr "向队列复制一个条目。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid ""
"Immediately available capacity is used even at an expired deadline. A finite"
" deadline bounds waiting; spurious wakes never restart its budget. No item "
"is retained on failure."
msgstr "即使截止时间已到期，仍使用立即可用的容量。有限截止时间约束等待；伪唤醒绝不重新开始等待预算。失败时不保留任何条目。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[in] At least item_size bytes, borrowed during call only"
msgstr "[in] 至少 item_size 字节，仅在调用期间借用"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[in] Absolute CLOCK_MONOTONIC deadline or NX_DEADLINE_NEVER"
msgstr "[in] CLOCK_MONOTONIC 绝对截止时间，或 NX_DEADLINE_NEVER"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "SUCCESS, TIMEOUT, STATE (closed) or error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、TIMEOUT、STATE（已关闭）或错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Receive one item; closed queues can still be drained."
msgstr "接收一个条目；关闭的队列仍可排空。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid ""
"An immediately available item can be received at an expired deadline. On "
"failure the output is unchanged. Closed queues return STATE only after "
"existing items have been drained."
msgstr "截止时间已到期时仍可接收立即可用的条目。失败时输出不变。关闭的队列仅在现有条目排空后返回 STATE。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[out] At least item_size bytes; valid only on SUCCESS"
msgstr "[out] 至少 item_size 字节；仅在 SUCCESS 时有效"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Reject sends and wake all waiting callers."
msgstr "拒绝发送，并唤醒全部正在等待的调用者。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Task context; caller must join queue users before destroy."
msgstr "任务上下文；调用者必须在 destroy 前 join 队列使用者。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "NX_SUCCESS or invalid error"
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS 或无效参数错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Destroy quiesced and drained queue storage."
msgstr "销毁已静止且已排空的队列存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[inout] Closed queue, no future users"
msgstr "[inout] 已关闭队列，之后不再有使用者"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "NX_SUCCESS or BUSY if users/items remain"
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS，或仍有使用者／条目时的 BUSY"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Start a task using the supplied host stack."
msgstr "使用供给的主机栈启动任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid ""
"Task context. No default task, pool or hidden stack exists. POSIX library "
"bookkeeping is host-runtime allocation, not MCU RAM evidence."
msgstr "任务上下文。没有默认任务、池或隐藏栈。POSIX 库的内部管理分配属于主机运行时，不能作为 MCU RAM 证据。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[out] Zero-initialized unused caller handle"
msgstr "[out] 已清零且尚未使用的调用者句柄"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[in] Aligned storage accepted by pthread_attr_setstack"
msgstr "[in] pthread_attr_setstack 接受的对齐存储"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[in] Host stack size, at least PTHREAD_STACK_MIN"
msgstr "[in] 主机栈大小，至少为 PTHREAD_STACK_MIN"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[in] Returning bounded application entry"
msgstr "[in] 会返回、执行有界的应用入口"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[in] Entry context, kept alive until join"
msgstr "[in] 入口上下文，保留直到 join"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "NX_SUCCESS or invalid/start error"
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS 或无效参数／启动错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Join after requesting cooperative application stop."
msgstr "请求应用协作停止之后执行 join。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid ""
"May block until entry returns. No forced cancellation. Caller may release "
"context, handle and stack only after success. One external owner serializes "
"start/join; multiple simultaneous joiners and external pthread_cancel/detach"
" are unsupported. Stop/join publishers before destroying their notification "
"or queue storage."
msgstr ""
"可能阻塞直到入口返回。不提供强制取消。调用者仅在成功后才可释放上下文、句柄和栈。一个外部所有者串行执行 start/join；不支持多个同时 join "
"的调用者，也不支持外部 pthread_cancel/detach。销毁通知或队列存储前，先停止并 join 发布者。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "[inout] Started task; caller must not be the joined task"
msgstr "[inout] 已启动的任务；调用者不得是被 join 的任务"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "NX_SUCCESS only after pthread_join confirms execution exit"
msgstr "仅在 pthread_join 确认执行已退出后返回 NX_SUCCESS"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Single waiter, multiple task publishers; fields are private."
msgstr "单等待者、多个 Task 发布者；字段为私有状态。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid ""
"Initialize/destroy have one external lifecycle owner. Stop and join all "
"publishers and the waiter before destroy. External pthread_cancel of a "
"caller blocked in these APIs is unsupported; use cooperative stop, publish "
"and join."
msgstr ""
"initialize/destroy 由一个外部生命周期所有者负责。destroy 前，停止并 join 所有发布者和等待者。不支持外部对阻塞在这些 "
"API 中的调用者执行 pthread_cancel；应使用协作停止、发布和 join。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Caller-sized queue storage; no heap or global object pool."
msgstr "由调用者确定容量的队列存储，不使用堆或全局对象池。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid ""
"One lifecycle owner initializes, closes and destroys. Multiple "
"producers/consumers are supported while live. External pthread_cancel of "
"blocked users is unsupported."
msgstr ""
"由一个生命周期所有者执行 initialize、close 和 destroy。存活期间支持多个生产者／消费者。不支持外部对阻塞使用者执行 "
"pthread_cancel。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid "Explicit task handle; stack storage is supplied at start."
msgstr "显式任务句柄；启动时供给栈存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:90
msgid ""
"Start/join are serialized by one external lifecycle owner; there is one "
"joiner. An entry may attempt a self-join, which returns BUSY. External "
"cancellation and detachment are unsupported."
msgstr ""
"由一个外部生命周期所有者串行执行 start/join；仅有一个 join 调用者。入口可以尝试自 join，此时返回 BUSY。不支持外部取消或 "
"detach。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:96
msgid "secure_context.h"
msgstr "secure_context.h"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Caller-owned Secure context leases for a trusted NS kernel."
msgstr "供可信 NS 内核使用的调用者自有 Secure 上下文租约。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Minimum context capacity excludes the eight-byte ARM stack seal."
msgstr "最小上下文容量不包含八字节 ARM 栈封印。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Secure-context integrity failures, distinct from normal rejection."
msgstr "Secure 上下文完整性失败，与普通拒绝区分。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Prepare exact Secure storage for one trusted task identity."
msgstr "为一个可信任务身份准备准确 Secure 存储。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid ""
"Secure privileged Thread startup/exclusive lifecycle owner. Both memory "
"spans must be Secure, writable and disjoint. No NS task may run against this"
" identity during prepare. Repeat prepare is rejected; epochs are never "
"reset. No allocation, kernel operation or runtime registry is used."
msgstr ""
"Secure 特权 Thread 启动上下文／独占生命周期所有者。两段内存都必须是 Secure、可写且互不重叠。prepare 期间，不得有 NS "
"任务以此身份运行。拒绝重复 prepare；epoch 绝不重置。不使用分配、内核操作或运行期注册表。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "[out] Zero-initialized caller-owned Secure metadata."
msgstr "[out] 已清零、由调用者拥有的 Secure 元数据。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "[in] Eight-byte-aligned Secure writable stack allocation."
msgstr "[in] 八字节对齐的 Secure 可写栈分配。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "[in] Whole allocation, including eight-byte upper seal."
msgstr "[in] 整块分配，包含上端八字节封印。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "[in] Opaque NS task identity, never dereferenced here."
msgstr "[in] 不透明 NS 任务身份，此处绝不解引用。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT, STATE or BUSY."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT、STATE 或 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Rebind retired metadata while preserving its epoch history."
msgstr "在保留 epoch 历史的前提下重新绑定已退役元数据。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid ""
"Secure lifecycle owner only after joining the previous task and stopping "
"every observer. Existing stack is reused; stale handles remain invalid after"
" the next allocation."
msgstr "仅限 Secure 生命周期所有者，在先前任务已 join 且每个观察者均已停止后调用。复用现有栈；下一次分配后，过期句柄仍无效。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "[inout] Prepared, unleased and unloaded Secure metadata."
msgstr "[inout] 已准备、未租出且未加载的 Secure 元数据。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "[in] New trusted NS task identity."
msgstr "[in] 新的可信 NS 任务身份。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Resolve a trusted, statically composed Secure task record."
msgstr "解析可信、静态组合的 Secure 任务记录。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid ""
"Secure application overrides the weak NULL default with an immutable "
"mapping. Called with both PRIMASK states held; never dereference an NS-"
"provided metadata pointer, allocate, block, discover objects, call a kernel "
"or mutate mappings. The NS kernel and its SVC/PendSV are trusted: this "
"mechanism does not authenticate an adversarial NS privileged kernel. NS "
"Thread calls cannot spoof Handler origin."
msgstr ""
"Secure 应用使用不可变映射覆盖弱 NULL 默认值。调用期间持有两侧 PRIMASK 状态；绝不能解引用 NS "
"提供的元数据指针、分配、阻塞、发现对象、调用内核或修改映射。NS 内核及其 SVC/PendSV 被信任：此机制不认证恶意 NS 特权内核。NS "
"Thread 调用不能伪装为 Handler 来源。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "[in] Opaque identity supplied by the trusted NS kernel."
msgstr "[in] 可信 NS 内核提供的不透明身份。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Prepared caller-owned metadata, or NULL when unauthorized."
msgstr "已准备、由调用者拥有的元数据；未获授权时为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Fail stop after a loaded Secure stack integrity failure."
msgstr "已加载 Secure 栈发生完整性失败后执行故障停止。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid ""
"Secure application may override to record/reset safely. Called with both "
"masks held; must not return, block, call a kernel or release retained "
"storage. Default holds masks and spins. No transport or product recovery "
"policy is imposed."
msgstr ""
"Secure "
"应用可覆盖以安全记录／复位。调用期间持有两侧屏蔽；不得返回、阻塞、调用内核或释放保留的存储。默认保持屏蔽并自旋。不强加传输机制或产品恢复策略。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "[in] Seal or stack invariant violation."
msgstr "[in] 封印或栈不变量被破坏。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid "Explicit Secure metadata, never stored in Nonsecure RAM."
msgstr "显式 Secure 元数据，绝不存放于 Nonsecure RAM。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:98
msgid ""
"Zero-initialize before prepare. Fields are mechanism-owned while prepared; "
"applications cannot modify them. Metadata and stack remain alive until the "
"task is joined, lease freed and no loaded context remains. Runtime Secure "
"stack capacity is an application budget, not this port minimum."
msgstr ""
"prepare 前清零。准备期间字段由机制拥有，应用不得修改。元数据和栈必须保持存活，直到任务已 join、租约已释放且不再有已加载上下文。Secure"
" 栈的运行期容量属于应用预算，不是此端口的最小值。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:104
msgid "threadx.h"
msgstr "threadx.h"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Caller-owned ThreadX task, wait and byte queue services."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 ThreadX 任务、等待和字节队列服务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid ""
"Privileged, single-core, current-security-domain APIs. All controls start "
"zeroed and remain adapter-owned while live. One external lifecycle owner "
"serializes init/destroy and joins; publishers, queue callers and IRQ sources"
" must quiesce before reclaiming storage. Runtime task operations require "
"unmasked Thread mode and a running kernel. Actual bootstrap permits object "
"init, task create/discard and wake; it does not permit blocking waits or "
"queue operations. A manual mask, ISR or unsupported context returns CONTEXT "
"before mutation. The byte queue's task threshold guard rejects foreign "
"priority-zero time-sliced callers. Caller controls, stack ranges, full "
"borrowed name/context objects, queue payloads, item buffers and waiters must"
" be disjoint. Cold admission rejects known control/stack/payload overlap and"
" name/context starting inside control or stack; unknown opaque extents "
"remain the caller's responsibility. Never operate a closable queue through "
"its raw inner queue. All deadlines use nx_time_now_us; NX_DEADLINE_NEVER is "
"an actual unbounded kernel wait. Timeout never revokes any accepted I/O "
"borrow. MPU/TZ isolation, tickless sleep and additional Cortex-M ports are "
"outside this backend scope."
msgstr ""
"特权、单核、当前安全域 API。所有控制存储初始清零，存活期间由适配器拥有。一个外部生命周期所有者串行执行 init/destroy 和 "
"join；回收存储前，发布者、队列调用者和 IRQ 源必须静止。运行期任务操作要求未屏蔽的 Thread 模式且内核正在运行。真实 bootstrap "
"允许对象初始化、任务 create/discard 和唤醒；不允许阻塞等待或队列操作。手动屏蔽、ISR 或不支持的上下文会在修改前返回 "
"CONTEXT。字节队列的任务阈值保护拒绝外来的优先级零时间片调用者。调用者控制存储、栈范围、完整借用的名称／上下文对象、队列载荷、条目缓冲区和等待者必须互不重叠。冷路径准入拒绝已知的控制／栈／载荷重叠，以及起始地址位于控制存储或栈内的名称／上下文；未知不透明对象的完整范围仍由调用者负责。绝不能通过可关闭队列内部的原始队列执行操作。所有截止时间均使用"
" nx_time_now_us；NX_DEADLINE_NEVER 是真正无界的内核等待。超时绝不撤销任何已接受的 I/O 借用。MPU/TZ 隔离、无"
" tick 睡眠及其他 Cortex-M 端口不属于此后端范围。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "One explicit caller latch per simultaneous close-aware operation."
msgstr "每个同时执行的关闭感知操作都显式拥有一个调用者锁存器。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Explicit irreversible kernel entry owned by the product."
msgstr "由产品拥有的显式、不可逆内核入口。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid ""
"Privileged cold Thread/MSP, no live FP context or masks. Startup may create "
"and discard unused static objects. After startup returns, the bootstrap "
"scope is sealed. Only the trusted kernel may call adapter "
"tx_application_define; it validates canonical privileged Thread context "
"before the product callback. This is not a security isolation API. An "
"unexpected kernel return invokes fail-stop and retains all effects; it never"
" reopens bootstrap reclamation."
msgstr ""
"特权冷启动 Thread/MSP，无存活 FP 上下文或屏蔽状态。启动阶段可创建并 discard 尚未使用的静态对象。启动返回后，bootstrap "
"范围即被封闭。只有可信内核可调用适配器 tx_application_define；适配器在产品回调之前验证规范的特权 Thread "
"上下文。这不是安全隔离 API。内核意外返回时调用故障停止并保留全部效果；绝不重新开放 bootstrap 回收。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Product initialization inside tx_application_define"
msgstr "[in] 在 tx_application_define 内执行的产品初始化"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Borrowed through startup and kernel lifetime"
msgstr "[in] 在整个启动及内核生命周期内借用"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "CONTEXT or INVALID before entry; successful entry never returns"
msgstr "进入前返回 CONTEXT 或 INVALID；成功进入后绝不返回"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Product failure hook; default parks forever."
msgstr "产品失败钩子；默认永久停驻。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid ""
"Actual fault context is not repaired or normalized; it may be masked, ISR or"
" unprivileged. Do not assume a working kernel, clock, stack or permission to"
" access a peripheral. The adapter observes the Core fault hook before this "
"hook. Product owns separately reviewed safe output/reset actions. Returning "
"does not authorize cleanup; the adapter parks."
msgstr ""
"不修复或规范化实际故障上下文；它可能处于屏蔽、ISR "
"或非特权状态。不得假定内核、时钟、栈可正常使用，也不得假定拥有访问外设的权限。适配器在此钩子之前先调用 Core "
"故障钩子。产品负责另外审查的安全输出／复位动作。返回不授权清理；适配器将停驻。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Context, permanent-entry or kernel-return failure"
msgstr "[in] 上下文、永久入口或内核返回失败"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Mandatory product hook only for explicit external Tick."
msgstr "仅显式外部 Tick 模式要求的产品钩子。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid ""
"Actual kernel bootstrap, privileged PRIMASK masked. Provider owns timer "
"clock and IRQ ceiling; it must not change the platform's continuous "
"monotonic clock. Missing hook fails linking. Failure enters retaining fail-"
"stop."
msgstr ""
"真实内核 bootstrap，特权且 PRIMASK 屏蔽。提供者负责定时器时钟和 IRQ "
"优先级上限；不得改变平台的连续单调时钟。缺少钩子会导致链接失败。失败将进入保留状态的故障停止。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Exact immutable resolved kernel frequency"
msgstr "[in] 准确、不可变、已解析的内核频率"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "SUCCESS after binding a real bounded periodic IRQ source"
msgstr "绑定真实、有界的周期 IRQ 源后返回 SUCCESS"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Read-only configurable-IRQ and selected mask-policy gate."
msgstr "只读的可配置 IRQ 与选定屏蔽策略检查。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Native has no hardware IRQ source and returns false."
msgstr "Native 没有硬件 IRQ 源，返回 false。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "True only in a privileged unmasked reviewed external IRQ"
msgstr "仅在特权、未屏蔽且经过审查的外部 IRQ 中返回 true"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Initialize one binary latch in task or actual bootstrap."
msgstr "在任务或真实 bootstrap 上下文初始化一个二值锁存器。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[inout] Zeroed caller control retained until destroy"
msgstr "[inout] 已清零的调用者控制存储，保留直到 destroy"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT or IO"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT 或 IO"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Bind a sequence hint and one concurrent blocking waiter."
msgstr "绑定序列提示和一个并发阻塞等待者。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid ""
"Binding/arm are reads. Wake supports task/bootstrap or an IRQ admitted by "
"nx_threadx_isr_allowed. Wait is task-only; finite deadline expiration "
"precedes a changed sequence."
msgstr ""
"绑定／arm 为只读操作。wake 支持任务／bootstrap，或经 nx_threadx_isr_allowed 准入的 IRQ。wait "
"仅限任务上下文；有限截止时间到期的判断优先于序列变化。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[inout] Live latch retained through every port user"
msgstr "[inout] 存活锁存器，须在每个端口使用者存活期间保留"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Wait face; empty face for null or non-live control"
msgstr "等待接口；控制存储为 null 或未存活时返回空接口"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Destroy only after all publishers and waiter quiesce."
msgstr "全部发布者和等待者静止后才允许销毁。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[inout] Live caller latch"
msgstr "[inout] 存活的调用者锁存器"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT, BUSY or IO; failure retains it"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT、BUSY 或 IO；失败时保留锁存器"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Create a cooperatively returning task using exact storage."
msgstr "使用准确存储创建可协作返回的任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid ""
"No adapter heap or worker. Name is borrowed, not copied. Linux uses its own "
"pthread stack; the caller buffer only validates kernel metadata and is not a"
" host stack budget. Higher-priority entries may run before start returns."
msgstr ""
"没有适配器堆或执行任务。名称被借用，不复制。Linux 使用自己的 pthread "
"栈；调用者缓冲区仅用于验证内核元数据，不是主机栈预算。优先级更高的入口可能在 start 返回前运行。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[inout] Zeroed caller TCB/control, retained until join/discard"
msgstr "[inout] 已清零的调用者 TCB／控制存储，保留直到 join/discard"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Borrowed immutable name, retained until reclamation"
msgstr "[in] 借用的不可变名称，保留直到回收"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Eight-byte aligned caller storage"
msgstr "[in] 八字节对齐的调用者存储"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Actual capacity, at least TX_MINIMUM_STACK"
msgstr "[in] 实际容量，至少为 TX_MINIMUM_STACK"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] ThreadX priority; smaller values run first"
msgstr "[in] ThreadX 优先级；数值越小越先运行"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Returns only after application stop/drain"
msgstr "[in] 仅在应用停止／排空后返回"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Borrowed until successful join/discard"
msgstr "[in] 借用直到成功 join/discard"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT or IO; partial failure retains live control if "
"reclamation cannot be established"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT 或 IO；部分失败且无法确认可回收时，保留存活控制存储"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Join a cooperatively returned task and prove detachment."
msgstr "对协作返回的任务执行 join，并证明引用已撤离。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid ""
"Self-join is rejected. Timeout retains task, borrowed name, stack and "
"context. Completion hint alone never reclaims; successful real kernel "
"deletion establishes detachment."
msgstr "拒绝自 join。超时保留任务、借用名称、栈和上下文。仅有完成提示绝不允许回收；真实内核删除成功才证明引用已撤离。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[inout] Live caller task, one external joiner only"
msgstr "[inout] 存活的调用者任务，仅允许一个外部 join 调用者"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Absolute Core deadline or NX_DEADLINE_NEVER"
msgstr "[in] 绝对 Core 截止时间，或 NX_DEADLINE_NEVER"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT, TIMEOUT or IO"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT、TIMEOUT 或 IO"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Discard an unused task only inside actual bootstrap."
msgstr "仅在真实 bootstrap 内丢弃尚未使用的任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "This is prestart rollback, never runtime cancellation."
msgstr "这是启动前回滚，绝不是运行期取消。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[inout] Live task whose entry has never begun"
msgstr "[inout] 存活且入口从未开始执行的任务"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT or IO; failure retains storage"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT 或 IO；失败时保留存储"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Start a permanent task without a completion latch."
msgstr "启动不含完成锁存器的永久任务。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Eight-byte stack alignment; failure can retain live state."
msgstr "栈按八字节对齐；失败时可能保留存活状态。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[inout] Zeroed caller control, retained until reset"
msgstr "[inout] 已清零的调用者控制存储，保留直到复位"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Borrowed immutable name, retained until reset"
msgstr "[in] 借用的不可变名称，保留直到复位"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Aligned caller buffer, retained until reset"
msgstr "[in] 已对齐的调用者缓冲区，保留直到复位"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Smaller ThreadX priority values run first"
msgstr "[in] ThreadX 优先级数值越小越先运行"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Never returns; return invokes retaining fail-stop"
msgstr "[in] 绝不返回；返回将触发保留状态的故障停止"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Borrowed until reset"
msgstr "[in] 借用直到复位"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Initialize an exact arbitrary-byte bounded queue."
msgstr "初始化支持准确任意字节条目的有界队列。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Caller payload storage retained until destroy"
msgstr "[in] 调用者载荷存储，保留直到 destroy"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Exact depth multiplied by item_size"
msgstr "[in] 准确的深度乘以 item_size"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Positive bounded capacity, below TX_WAIT_FOREVER"
msgstr "[in] 正数、有界且小于 TX_WAIT_FOREVER 的容量"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Positive byte count, without word-size narrowing"
msgstr "[in] 正数字节数，不缩减为字尺寸"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Task-only send; immediate readiness wins over expiration."
msgstr "仅 Task 发送；立即就绪优先于截止到期。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[inout] Live queue retained throughout the operation"
msgstr "[inout] 存活队列，在整个操作期间保留"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[in] Exactly item_size readable bytes borrowed until return"
msgstr "[in] 准确的 item_size 个可读字节，借用直到返回"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT, TIMEOUT, OVERFLOW or IO"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT、TIMEOUT、OVERFLOW 或 IO"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "Task-only receive; output changes only on SUCCESS."
msgstr "仅 Task 接收；只在 SUCCESS 时修改输出。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
msgid "[out] Exactly item_size writable bytes borrowed until return"
msgstr "[out] 准确的 item_size 个可写字节，借用直到返回"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:106
