msgstr "只有配置中显式声明的 OS 策略启用这些符号时，应用才实现它们。不提供弱定时器／计数器回退实现。平台绝不臆造定时器接线。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:114
msgid "Configure the application's selected kernel Tick source."
msgstr "配置应用选定的内核 Tick 源。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:114
msgid ""
"Scheduler startup calls this in its canonical masked, privileged context. "
"Configure a periodic interrupt, clear pending state and route it to the "
"selected kernel Tick handler at its validated priority. Do not start tasks "
"here. Hardware clock and routing remain application/SoC-owned."
msgstr ""
"调度器启动时在其规范、已屏蔽、特权上下文调用。配置周期中断，清除 pending 状态，并以已验证的优先级路由到选定内核 Tick "
"处理函数。不得在此启动任务。硬件时钟和路由仍由应用／SoC 拥有。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:114
