msgstr "观察到谓词为 true 时返回 NX_SUCCESS，包括 TIMEOUT 后的最后一次观察；否则返回端口错误"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:122
msgid "Single-waiter notification port."
msgstr "单等待者通知端口。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/api/os.md:122
msgid ""
"Caller owns storage and serializes arm/wait. Multiple wake publishers are "
"permitted by each backend's documented context. Sequence is a hint; the "
"predicate/request is authoritative. There must be fewer than 2^32 wakes "
"between arm and recheck. All deadlines are absolute monotonic microseconds "
"in the backend's clock domain, with NX_DEADLINE_NEVER explicitly disabling "
"timeout. Clocks must continue while waiting and never change domain; "
"construct relative budgets with nx_deadline_after to avoid overflow. A "
"timeout does not settle a request or release its buffers. Before destroy, "
"stop and join every publisher and waiter; SETTLED alone does not prove "
"notification storage is reclaimable. arm snapshots the sequence. wait must "
"atomically observe a changed sequence or a latched wake, including a wake "
"between the caller's recheck and sleeping. A changed sequence cannot bypass "
"a finite deadline: wait checks expiry on every call and every return from "
"blocking before reporting a hint. A nonblocking backend may return BUSY "
"while unexpired. Only one owner may arm/wait; a second concurrent wait is "
"outside the port contract even when a backend rejects it."
msgstr ""
"调用者拥有存储，并串行执行 arm/wait。各后端文档规定的上下文允许多个唤醒发布者。序列只是提示；谓词／请求才是权威依据。arm "
"与重新检查之间的唤醒次数必须少于 2^32。所有截止时间均为后端时钟域内的绝对单调微秒时间；NX_DEADLINE_NEVER "
"显式禁用超时。时钟必须在等待期间连续运行且不得改变时间域；应使用 nx_deadline_after "
"构造相对预算，避免溢出。超时不会使请求结清或释放缓冲区。销毁前，必须停止并 join 每个发布者和等待者；仅有 SETTLED "
"不能证明通知存储可回收。arm 快照序列；wait "
"必须原子地观察序列变化或已锁存唤醒，包括调用者再次检查与睡眠之间发生的唤醒。序列变化不能绕过有限截止时间：wait "
"在每次调用以及每次从阻塞返回后，都先检查到期，再报告提示。未到期时，非阻塞后端可以返回 BUSY。仅一个所有者可以执行 "
"arm/wait；即使后端会拒绝第二个并发等待，其行为仍位于端口合同之外。"
